Glen, this looks great. Please let the FSG know that we'd like to plan a
joint brainstorm Tuesday evening. This will be a venue for anyone to
introduce new topics, issues, projects etc that they feel either FSG, PWG or
jointly we should focus on. This will be a better chance to "rub elbows"
than the joint Plenary which will be mostly reporting. If we get feedback
that most people want to join this effort, I plan to just hold the
conference room through the evening and we'll just pass the hat for pizza,
sandwiches etc. 
